---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const CC0 = 'https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/';
const REPO = 'https://github.com/nickolaj-jepsen/walldye';
---

<Base title="About" description="How the Walldye wallpapers are made and recoloured, and how to download them." nav="about" mainClass="about">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Walldye is a collection of stylized <abbr>SVG</abbr> wallpapers, each based on three colours (background, foreground and accent), which makes it possible to customize them to your existing desktop theme.</p>
    <p>Most of the wallpapers are generated from code, often written by AI models like Claude, but every one of them is manually curated and validated. Sources and attributions are available on every page.</p>
    <p>The code is open source and licensed under <abbr>GPLv3</abbr>, available on <a href={REPO}>GitHub</a>. Wherever possible, the resulting wallpaper is licensed <a href={CC0}>CC0</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
